{"seq":1,"slug":"return-reduction-kpi-instrumentation","title":"退货削减 KPI 定义与埋点口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/return-reduction-fit-assurance-program/program-ops-measurement/return-reduction-kpi-instrumentation","wordCount":2913,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"退货削减-kpi-定义与埋点口径\">退货削减 KPI 定义与埋点口径</h1><p>同一家公司里，履约团队报的退货率是 18%，财务月报里是 11%，商品团队看到的又是 24%。三个数字都「对」，因为它们算的根本不是同一件事：一个按件数、一个按金额扣掉退款手续费、一个按订单行且只看服饰类。退货削减项目最常见的死法不是方案无效，而是<strong>指标口径没有统一</strong>——项目上线三个月，没人能说清退货率到底降了没有。本文回答一个工程问题：退货削减相关的 KPI 如何定义、如何埋点、如何做到可复算与可归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-退货率不是一个指标-而是一族口径\">核心概念：退货率不是一个指标，而是一族口径</h2><p>先给可操作定义。**退货率（return rate）**是一个比值，其分子是「被退回的量」，分母是「可供退回的基准量」，二者都必须带单位与口径标签。缺少任一标签的数字不可用。行业报告里常见的量级可以直接感受到口径的差异：NRF 与 Happy Returns 的年度《Returns Landscape》报告给出的美国零售退货规模在 8,000 亿美元量级、退货率约 15%–17%（2024 年前后口径，按销售额计）；而服饰线上渠道的退货率长期落在 20%–30%（Narvar、Coresight Research 系列消费者报告给出的常见区间为 20%–40%）。两者相差近一倍，差别不在统计质量，在分子分母的定义。</p>\n<p>退货相关 KPI 的最小完备集是五个，各自回答不同的问题，任何一次汇报都必须明确引用的是哪一个：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;销售基数&lt;br/&gt;售出件数 / 金额 / 订单行&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;gross 退货率&lt;br/&gt;退回量 ÷ 售出量&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;net 退货率&lt;br/&gt;(退回量 − 换货量 − 拦截量)÷ 售出量&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;保留率&lt;br/&gt;1 − gross 退货率&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;合身类退货占比&lt;br/&gt;尺码+版型原因 ÷ 全部退货&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;合身退货率&lt;br/&gt;= gross 退货率 × 合身类占比&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; G[&quot;退货处理成本率&lt;br/&gt;逆向物流+质检+折价 ÷ 售出额&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"销售基数&lt;br/&gt;售出件数 / 金额 / 订单行\"] --&gt; B[\"gross 退货率&lt;br/&gt;退回量 ÷ 售出量\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"net 退货率&lt;br/&gt;(退回量 − 换货量 − 拦截量)÷ 售出量\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"保留率&lt;br/&gt;1 − gross 退货率\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"合身类退货占比&lt;br/&gt;尺码+版型原因 ÷ 全部退货\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"合身退货率&lt;br/&gt;= gross 退货率 × 合身类占比\"]\n  B --&gt; G[\"退货处理成本率&lt;br/&gt;逆向物流+质检+折价 ÷ 售出额\"]</pre><p>其中三个需要额外说明。**净退货率（net return rate）**扣除的是「没有真正流失的退货」：原单换码（exchange）、发货前拦截（cancellation on return intent）、以及退货后原用户再购（rebuy within window）。它的分母不变、分子变小，因此永远低于 gross 值，常被用作品牌叙事；工程上必须两个都报，否则无法区分「退货真的少了」和「退货只是被换货吸收」。<strong>合身退货率</strong>是一个乘积，而不是独立采集的字段——这一点是埋点设计的分水岭：如果系统只采集「退货原因 = 尺码偏小」这一条标签的计数，就无法与售出基数对齐，因为它缺分母。<strong>退货处理成本率</strong>把逆向物流费、质检人力、折价二次销售损失、以及被销毁库存的残值损失汇总。跨境场景下它的量级远高于国内：一票从欧洲退回亚洲的包裹，逆向运费常常超过商品本身毛利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"口径分歧的四个轴\">口径分歧的四个轴</h2><p>口径争议几乎全部落在四个轴上。把它们显式化，是 KPI 文档能落地的前提。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轴</th>\n<th>可选口径</th>\n<th>差异来源</th>\n<th>工程建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分子</td>\n<td>件数 / 金额 / 订单行 / 退货单</td>\n<td>高价与低价品类权重不同</td>\n<td>件数为主，金额为辅；两者都发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分母</td>\n<td>售出额 / 发货额 / 签收额 / 结算额</td>\n<td>时间错配（售出在下月退回）</td>\n<td>分母用**同批次（cohort）**发货额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>窗口</td>\n<td>30 / 60 / 90 / 180 天</td>\n<td>退货政策期限不同</td>\n<td>窗口 = 政策退货期 + 7 天缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因</td>\n<td>首触 / 末触 / 线性 / 时间衰减</td>\n<td>多触点争夺功劳</td>\n<td>增量为准，归因仅作诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分母是最容易被忽略的一轴。若分子按「本月发生的退货」统计、分母按「本月售出额」统计，就产生经典的<strong>时间错配（time-matching bias）</strong>：旺季销量暴涨的月份，退货率会被系统性压低，因为当月售出的大量订单还没到退货期。正确做法是 cohort 口径——取某一批「在 T 周发货」的订单，追踪其在窗口内的退货，得到该批次的退货率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>退货件数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>cohort</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>发货件数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>cohort</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>政策退货期</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t = \\frac{\\text{退货件数}(\\text{cohort}=t,\\ \\Delta \\le W)}{S_t},\\qquad S_t = \\text{发货件数}(\\text{cohort}=t),\\ W=\\text{政策退货期}+7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退货件数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cohort</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发货件数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cohort</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">政策退货期</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>窗口长度必须显式写进指标名（例如 <code>return_rate_d60</code>），不能叫裸的「退货率」。跨境场景还有一层：不同市场的法定退货期本身就不同。欧盟《消费者权利指令》（2011/83/EU）赋予 14 天撤回权，多国平台（如 Zalando）自愿延长到 100 天，而日本市场的商业惯例与合规退货窗口另成一套。把所有市场塞进同一个 30 天窗口，等于用一个市场的政策去评判另一个市场的表现。想看清退货究竟由什么驱动，需要先把基线按市场、品类、渠道分层——分层口径本身在 <code>../1_return-driver-fit-diagnosis/3_return-rate-baseline-segmentation.md</code> 里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"埋点口径-从事件契约到指标可复算\">埋点口径：从事件契约到指标可复算</h2><p>指标不可复算，通常是因为埋点只记录了「发生了什么」，没有记录「属于哪一批」「口径是什么」。能支撑上表所有口径的最小事件集是四个对象，每个都必须带幂等的业务主键与口径标签：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>为什么必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>order_shipped</code></td>\n<td>order_id, line_id, sku, qty, amount, ship_ts, market</td>\n<td>提供分母与 cohort 锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>return_initiated</code></td>\n<td>return_id, line_id, qty, reason_code, sub_reason, init_ts, channel</td>\n<td>提供分子与原因分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>return_received</code></td>\n<td>return_id, receive_ts, condition, disposition</td>\n<td>区分「发起退货」与「真正退回」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exchange_created</code></td>\n<td>exchange_id, orig_line_id, new_line_id</td>\n<td>计算净退货率的扣减项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fit_signal</code></td>\n<td>session_id, sku, size_shown, size_selected, chart_version</td>\n<td>把前端合身动作与退货结果连接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>return_initiated</code> 与 <code>return_received</code> 必须分开。发起退货到包裹实际退回之间存在 5–20 天的流失，用户可能中途取消、可能寄丢、也可能根本不寄。若不分离，退货率会在退货包裹集中到达的时点出现锯齿状波动，任何按周的对比都不可信。同时 <code>reason_code</code> 必须是<strong>受控词表</strong>而非自由文本——本 hub 的退货原因分类体系（尺码/版型/色差/质量/描述不符/无理由）在 <code>../1_return-driver-fit-diagnosis/1_return-reason-taxonomy-fit-classification.md</code> 中定义，KPI 层只做聚合。缺少受控词表时，「尺码偏小」与「size runs small」会被算成两个不同原因，合身类占比直接失真。</p>\n<p>还有两个容易被漏掉的标识：<strong>口径版本</strong>与<strong>前端实验分组</strong>。任何一条退货记录都应带上当时生效的推荐模型版本、尺码表版本与实验分组；否则在归因阶段无法回答「这批退货是在旧尺码表下产生的吗」。跨系统对齐这件事与尺码数据本身的治理是同一套纪律，参见 <code>../3_fit-data-quality/1_measurement-spec-size-schema-governance.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量度量-如何证明退货削减项目真的有效\">增量度量：如何证明退货削减项目真的有效</h2><p>对比上线前后的退货率几乎必然得出错误结论，因为季节性、促销节奏、品类结构、宏观消费都在一起变化。要证明因果，只有一条路：<strong>随机化的对照组</strong>。把合身干预（尺码推荐、Try-before-buy、详细尺码表）按用户或会话随机分流，用两组退货率之差作为增量效应。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>treat</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>ctrl</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau} = r_{\\text{treat}} - r_{\\text{ctrl}},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SE}(\\hat{\\tau}) = \\sqrt{\\frac{r_T(1-r_T)}{n_T} + \\frac{r_C(1-r_C)}{n_C}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ctrl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1106em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9294em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstru